kit/3dcv: licence and credits
=============================

What this directory is
----------------------
kit/3dcv holds code ported into moodreel from the 3DCodeVerse awesome showcase: the generic look engine of the
showcase's 30-second film (a ramp material with surface-anchored stipple, a painterly post chain with tone-weighted
grain, canvas-painted textures, stroke lettering and deterministic helpers) and the runtime its shots ran in, adapted
into a shot adapter for moodreel's stage (kit/stage.js). Nothing film-specific was ported: no shots, sets, characters,
props or assets.

Creator and source
------------------
Creator: 3DCodeVerse, https://github.com/gaoypeng/3dcodeverse
Source:  the 3DCodeVerse awesome showcase dataset,
         https://huggingface.co/datasets/3dcodeverse/3dcodeverse-awesome-showcase
         the 30-second film's code, src/core/, round r02. The files, with their git blob ids:

  src/core/look.js    353f5696c49e0076ad2502b4aa87590af36d2c7c   -> kit/3dcv/look.js
  src/core/post.js    8eff026f46adcac9581ff9a1776236df800c45f8   -> kit/3dcv/post.js
  src/core/paint.js   7e55945c9231e069ce8dbe6ae024585e2fe473e6   -> kit/3dcv/paint.js
  src/core/text.js    706a7faa118058ba4af0b5f168a6c37a41aa7154   -> kit/3dcv/text.js
  src/core/util.js    7b29cec7e017860a19245cd45cd8822b3001e082   -> kit/3dcv/util.js
